  "description": "Luxury Penthouse Apartment. Highly advised to view. \n\nA light filled, top floor, two bedroom penthouse apartment in an unbeatable location in the heart of the thriving Dublin Docklands with a Luas stop on your doorstep. An exceptionally bright apartment owing to the west-facing aspect, floor to ceiling windows and high ceilings. The interior of the apartment comprises entrance hallway, open plan living/dining room, kitchen, two spacious double rooms, a large bathroom and a balcony. All rooms have access to the balcony, which is cushioned with artificial grass, bamboo privacy screening, feature lighting and an outdoor plug. The spacious apartment has recently underwent extensive renovation, both decorative and structural. It comes equipped with oven, washer/dryer, dishwasher and excellent storage units. Other key features include an energy efficient district heating system and 24 hour security on site.\n\nBeresford House is exceptionally well located. Nearby attractions include the 3Arena, Dublin Convention Centre, Bord Gais Energy Theatre, Grand Canal Dock, Croke Park, O’Connell Street, gyms, coffee shops such as 3FE, supermarkets such as Tesco, Dunnes Stores and many more, all within walking distance. The nearby Connolly Station offers DART and train services. The nearby Busaras offers all bus routes. The nearby Port Tunnel offers easy access to both the M1 and M50 motorways and Dublin Airport. \n\nPresented in turn key condition with parking space. Utility bills are not included.",
